## To release a new version, edit the version in the two lines below and nothing else.
## |cRRGGBB...|r in Title and Author colours them in the in-game add-on list; the version
## is read back through that markup, so it can sit inside or outside the colour.
## The settings panel takes its version from ## Title; the name itself is fixed in Main.lua.
## Title: |cFF69B4PB’s GammaAdjuster|r 1.1.0
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Fixes the console game forgetting your brightness at login. The brightness saved in Calibrate Brightness stays stored but the screen comes up at the default; this add-on asks the game to apply the saved value again as soon as you enter the world. It cannot choose a brightness itself. /pbgamma shows what the game answered.
## Version: 1.1.0
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## DependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
## SavedVariables: PBsGammaAdjuster_Data

lang/strings.lua
lang/$(language).lua

Main.lua
Settings.lua

